#{{AIHEADER}}:1
TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="app/**, lib/**, config/**"

LANGUAGE_RUNTIME:
- Ruby 3.3+ (fill in exact version in .ruby-version)
- Rails 7.x or 8.x (fill in exact version)
- Bundler for gems — do not gem install outside bundle exec

BUILD:
- No compile step — but run: bundle exec rails assets:precompile for production
- Lint: bundle exec rubocop
- DB: bundle exec rails db:migrate

STYLE_CONVENTIONS:
- RuboCop enforced — no disables without a comment
- Thin controllers: business logic belongs in service objects or models
- ActiveRecord callbacks sparingly — prefer explicit service calls
- Prefer keyword arguments for methods with 3+ parameters

FORBIDDEN_PATTERNS:
- No raw SQL without sanitization — use ActiveRecord or sanitize_sql
- No secrets in source — use Rails credentials or env vars
- No synchronous external HTTP calls in request cycle — use background jobs
- No puts / p in production code — use Rails.logger

EXPLICITLY_NOT_TOUCHING:
- (fill in: generated migrations in progress, schema.rb when migrating, etc.)
